Z||000003||Monkeyman||08-12-2000||09:37 AM||||What kind of seats?  Stock seats could be bought for around $40/pair around here, but probably have been sitting out in the weather which would make them absolutely worthless.  I know one boneyard that has a set of Beretta GTZ seats (nice support and lumbar, too) for $50/pair, but they need recovered.  Supposedly there's a set of <I>cloth</I> F-body seats (all power) in good condition, cheap.  I didn't even bother to check that out, though, because I think he's pulling my leg.  (They only made those in leather, right???)||||reg||1
